{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n最新一集TVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》中，大受歡迎的Mandy阮嘉敏與東東吳旭東面對1,500公里遙距戀愛考驗！東東在節目中驚爆為愛犧牲西安的短劇工作，更減少陪伴患病母親的時間，說到情深處更在鏡頭前忍不住落淚，場面極之感人。他更為給Mandy美好回憶，決心克服畏高症坐上摩天輪，究竟二人能否衝破地理距離的障礙？\n</p>\n<h2>東東畏高陪坐摩天輪 Mandy大讚浪漫</h2>\n<p>在日前的甜蜜約會中，東東為了給Mandy一個難忘的體驗，竟安排了畏高者聞之色變的摩天輪之旅。雖然全程心驚驚，一時捉緊Mandy，一時攬實條柱「定驚」，但東東仍不忘捉緊機會，單刀直入試探Mandy心意：「你喜歡無微不至的照顧或是幽默？」明顯是想知道Mandy喜歡Hepta的類型還是自己。Mandy亦相當「識趣」，坦言自己較喜歡有幽默感的男生：「因為我唔係小朋友喇嘛，我諗係唔同年紀嘅唔同需要。」事後Mandy對這個約會安排大感窩心，直言非常浪漫：「可以同佢分享我由細到大成長嘅地方，其實我都幾開心」、「拍拖就係想要呢啲嘢，當下嘅感覺好真實，係好值得擁有嘅回憶。」</p>\n<h2>東東爆喊為愛犧牲 Mandy內疚獲溫柔安慰</h2>\n<p>原來在浪漫背後，東東為這段感情付出了巨大犧牲。他坦承為了多點時間陪伴Mandy，不但推掉了在西安的短劇工作，也少了時間陪伴患病的母親，更因擔心媽媽一度在錄影期間落淚。Mandy對此大感內疚，但東東卻溫柔地安慰她不要自責，強調一切都是自發和自願，更透露媽媽非常支持他追愛：「我媽一直非常支持我追Mandy。」Mandy亦承認一直逃避處理遠距離問題，怕逼得對方太緊，當得知東東認真思考過未來時，她激動地說：「佢有好認真咁諗過，我覺得好好。」東東最後更派定心丸：「距離是個問題，但我覺得很多東西是可以解決的。」真摯互動令兩人雙雙眼濕濕。</p>\n<h2>掟公仔贏得美人歸 東東：公仔係我哋嘅浪漫連結</h2>\n<p>除了摩天輪，東東還應Mandy要求去「掟公仔」，並成功為她贏得一對可愛的「卡皮巴拉」玩偶，更搞笑地將它們命名為「拉麵」和「筷子」，成功逗得Mandy笑逐顏開。這個小小的戰利品在東東心中有著特殊意義，他自豪地表示，這對玩偶是他與Mandy之間的浪漫連結：「我希望她看到玩偶就會想到我。」這個舉動顯然深深打動了Mandy，她更透露自己的半張床都已經堆滿了東東送的公仔，可見東東為了維繫這段1,500公里的感情，花了不少心思製造甜蜜驚喜。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚真性情：最睇好嘅一對</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，Mandy與東東的真情流露感動大量網民，大家紛紛留言表示支持。網民一面倒大讚Mandy體貼大方：「好為人著想，唔港女，真心正」、「又靚又有主見又搞笑」、「外表靚又有有趣靈魂」、「思想好成熟」。同時，網民亦對東東的付出給予高度評價，認為他是真性情的好男人：「最睇好嘅一對」、「兩個都是真心會為對方考慮的人，希望得到愛神眷顧」、「東東真是好男人」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04c_5498354476afa84f6e9b06.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04c_5498354476afa84f6e9b06.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04a_17461343966afa851f92700.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04a_17461343966afa851f92700.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_16371420116afa859e9feed.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_16371420116afa859e9feed.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_1899120116afa8648c7727.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_1899120116afa8648c7727.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_1730079956afa8652efac2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_1730079956afa8652efac2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_19417952766afa865b14fc7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_19417952766afa865b14fc7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_20977737126afa852b649f6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_20977737126afa852b649f6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_633240736afa855003a7b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_633240736afa855003a7b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_15380824656afa85571df17.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_15380824656afa85571df17.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_19538123966afa855e22196.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_19538123966afa855e22196.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_9561828626afa856529939.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_9561828626afa856529939.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_7493876566afa856c3154c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_7493876566afa856c3154c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_16367881266afa857af1ef4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_16367881266afa857af1ef4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T05:53:50.277593+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1536,"images":13,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T05:31:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T07:27:58.197837+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T05:47:16.991179+00:00","content_hash":"6a35da41f4c4a6e47fb6392fb68762474aaa154b6a5d17a548c168c059f41f2d","evidence_status":"full","